<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Francesco Bedussi, senior software engineer</title>

    <style>
        :root {
            --accent-color: teal;
        }

        body {
            font-family: sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            padding: 0rem;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .boxed {
            max-width: 80rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .headline {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-family: sans-serif;
        }

        .value-proposition {
            font-size: 2rem;
            border-left: 1rem solid var(--accent-color);
            padding-left: 1rem;
            
            strong {
                padding: 0rem 0.5rem 0.5rem;
                font-weight: 100;
                background-color: var(--accent-color);
                color: white;
                font-style: italic;
                display: inline-block;
                font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
                border-radius: 5px;
            }
        }

        .name,
        footer {
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: white;
        }

        .name>div {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;

            img {
                border-radius: 50%;
                width: 10rem;
                height: 10rem;
                display: block;
            }

            * {
                margin: 0;
            }

            >div {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
            }
        }

        details {
            border: solid 2px var(--accent-color);
            border-radius: 10px;
            interpolate-size: allow-keywords;
        }

        details::details-content {
            padding: 0rem 1rem;
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 0;
            transition: height 0.3s ease, content-visibility 0.3s allow-discrete;
        }

        details[open]::details-content {
            height: auto;

            @starting-style {
                height: 0;
            }
        }

        summary {
            cursor: pointer;
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            color: white;
        }

        summary::marker,
        summary::-webkit-details-marker {
            display: none;
        }

        summary::before {
            content: '+';
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 1;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        details[open] summary::before {
            transform: rotate(45deg);
        }

        details>div {
            display: grid;
            gap: 1rem;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15em, 1fr));
        }

        .experience {
            list-style: none;
            padding-left: 0;
        }

        .experience>li {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .experience>li>* {
            grid-column: 2;
        }


        .experience>li .time-span {
            grid-column: 1;
            grid-row: 1;
            padding: 0rem 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 200;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: white;
            font-style: italic;
            height: fit-content;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 40em) {
            .experience>li {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 7em 1fr;
                column-gap: 0.5rem;
            }

            .experience>li>p:first-of-type {
                margin-top: 0;
            }

            .experience>li .time-span {
                text-align: right;
            }

            .experience>li>p+p {
                margin-top: 0;
            }
        }

        .portfolio {
            background-color: lightgray;

            ul {
                list-style: none;
                padding-left: 0;
                display: grid;
                gap: 1rem;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
                grid-auto-flow: dense;
            }
        }

        .portfolio figure {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .portfolio figcaption {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 0.4rem;
            color: #333;
        }

        button[commandfor] {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            padding: 0;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            margin-top: 0.75rem;
        }

        button[command="show-modal"] {
            display: block;
            overflow: hidden;
            aspect-ratio: 2;
        }

        dialog {
            max-width: min(90vw, 70rem);
            border: none;
            padding: 0;
            background: #000;
            position: fixed;
            opacity: 1;
            transition:
                opacity 0.3s ease,
                display 0.3s allow-discrete,
                overlay 0.3s allow-discrete;

            &:not([open]) {
                opacity: 0;
            }

            @starting-style {
                &[open] {
                    opacity: 0;
                }
            }

            &::backdrop {
                background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
                opacity: 1;
                transition:
                    opacity 0.3s ease,
                    display 0.3s allow-discrete,
                    overlay 0.3s allow-discrete;
            }

            @starting-style {
                &[open]::backdrop {
                    opacity: 0;
                }
            }
        }

        dialog:not([open])::backdrop {
            opacity: 0;
        }

        img {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }

        button[command="close"] {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0.5rem;
            right: 0.5rem;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #fff;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        footer {
            a,
            a:visited {
                color: inherit;
                text-decoration: none;
            }
        }
    </style>

</head>

<body>
    <header class="boxed">
        <p class="headline">Who am I?
        <p>This page is my answer to this question, delivered the same way I approach any task: I chose the simplest solution that fully meets the requirements. In this case, a static HTML page, minimal CSS, no build complexity. Fast, secure, accessible, responsive and maintenance-free.
        <p class="value-proposition">That's what I do: I cut through to the <strong>most effective solution</strong> for the job at hand.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="name">
        <div class="boxed">
            <img src="media/avatar.jpg" alt="Francesco Bedussi photo">
            <div>
                <h1>Francesco Bedussi</h1>
                <p><strong>Senior software engineer</strong>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main class="boxed">
        <h2>What I've done</h2> 

        <p>I started programming as a child in the '80s and never stopped. I've been <strong>a professional in the web industry since 2001</strong>, covering various roles, from project manager to software developer and tech lead. 
        <p>Over the years I've built up solid experience handling projects for <strong>major players</strong>, from leading e-commerce platforms to worldwide luxury brands and top-level insurance companies.
        
        <ol class="experience">
            <li>
                <div class="time-span"><time datetime="2024">2024-present</time></div>
                <p><strong>Software Engineer at <a href="https://www.prima.it/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prima</a></strong>
                <p>I'm a senior Software Engineer in a team in charge of modernizing the legacy system of the largest motor insurance broker in Italy.
                <p>What my team accomplished so far:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>rebuilt the internal knowledge</strong> on the implemented business logic that was lost
                        due to the rapid
                        growth of the company</li>
                    <li>set up a comprehensive suite of <strong>automated tests</strong> to serve as a guardrail for
                        later refactors</li>
                    <li><strong>increased the conversion rate by 1%</strong> just by upgrading the funnel to the latest version of the corporate design system</li>
                    <li><strong>split</strong> a monolith into 4 micro-frontends</li>
                    <li><strong>migrated</strong> the codebase from Elm to React to eliminate one language from the tech
                        stack, reduce the
                        cognitive load, simplify the hiring process and eliminate some risks of using a niche language
                    </li>
                    <li><strong>simplified the architecture</strong>, eliminating unnecessary middleware, removing another language from the tech stack</li>
                </ul>
            </li>

            <li>
                <div class="time-span"><time datetime="2019">2019</time>-<time datetime="2024">2024</time></div>
                <p><strong>Tech lead at <a href="https://www.abstract.it/it" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Abstract</a></strong>
                <p>In this consultancy firm, I was the tech lead of several projects for <strong>Luxottica</strong>, the
                    global market
                    leader
                    in the eyewear industry.
                <p>Some projects we carried out:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Successfully bootstrapped a greenfield telemedicine system <strong>used by opticians in 3
                            continents</strong>
                        to
                        handle remote eye visits</li>
                    <li>Delivered a B2B e-commerce platform to effectively handle the pre-sale process during the
                        corporate
                        trade shows. The project featured a <strong>wow factor</strong> to match the positioning of the
                        luxury brands
                        involved, paired with the capacity to handle carts of 3000+ items without delays</li>
                </ul>
            </li>

            <li>
                <div class="time-span"><time datetime="2015">2015</time>-<time datetime="2019">2019</time></div>
                <p><strong>Developer and Tech lead at <a href="https://www.yoox.com" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            target="_blank">Yoox/YNAP</a></strong>
                <p>My team and I launched and maintained several e-commerce websites for some of the top fashion
                    brands,
                    such as <strong>Armani</strong>, Dsquared2 and Maison Margiela. The sites generated revenues of up to 200k euros per day.  
            </li>

            <li>
                <div class="time-span"><time datetime="2011">2011</time>-<time datetime="2015">2015</time></div>
                <p><strong>Front end developer freelance</strong>
                <p>I helped local businesses and non-profit organizations to strengthen their online presence.
            </li>

            <li>
                <div class="time-span"><time datetime="2008">2008</time>-<time datetime="2014">2014</time></div>
                <p><strong>Web marketing consultant at <a href="https://www.viro.it" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Viro</a></strong>
                <p>For Viro, a market leader in the lock industry:
                <ul>
                    <li>I designed and implemented the corporate web marketing strategy.</li>
                    <li>I created, developed and edited for 3 years the corporate blog, with weekly updates in 4
                        languages, as
                        a
                        powerful tool of content marketing</li>
                    <li>As the social media and community manager I dealt with online communities related to mechanical
                        security
                        topics.</li>
                </ul>
            </li>

            <li>
                <div class="time-span"><time datetime="2007">2007</time>-<time datetime="2014">2014</time></div>
                <p><strong>Communication manager at <a href="https://centroantartide.it/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Centro
                            Antartide</a></strong>
                <p>We ran several national awareness-raising campaigns, among which:
                <ul>
                    <li>Vacanze coi fiocchi and Siamo tutti pedoni on road safety</li>
                    <li>the EU-funded project on water saving, Wataclick</li>
                </ul>
            </li>

            <li>
                <div class="time-span"><time datetime="2004">2004</time>-<time datetime="2008">2008</time></div>
                <p><strong>Co-founder of Caffè Network</strong>
                <p>Caffè Network was an agency specialized in the set-up, fine-tuning and
                    monitoring of distribution networks for free press projects.
                <p>We worked for some of the biggest players in the industry, like the newspaper City and the magazine
                    Urban, both edited by RCS Media Group.
                <p>We also edited a monthly free press magazine, “l’ammazzacaffè”, printed on table mats and distributed
                    in
                    pubs and restaurants.
            </li>
            <li>
                <div class="time-span"><time datetime="2002">2002</time>-<time datetime="2003">2003</time></div>
                <p><strong>Project manager at O-One</strong>
                <p>I was an account and project leader of a web agency that worked with clients like Berloni, Kerakoll
                    and
                    Vodafone. My role dealt with customer relationships, business development and project management.
            </li>
        </ol>

        <details>
            <summary>Some technologies I worked with</summary>
            <div>
                <div>
                    <h3>Frontend</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>HTML</li>
                        <li>CSS</li>
                        <li>JavaScript</li>
                        <li>TypeScript</li>
                        <li>React</li>
                        <li>Elm</li>
                        <li>Web Components</li>
                        <li>Redux</li>
